    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active products with SBQQ__PricingMethod__c = &apos;Cost&apos; but no PricebookEntry on the active pricebook.
Why it matters: Cost-priced products need a PBE to determine cost+markup — without it the calc fails or zeros out. The catalog shows the product as priceable; quotes break.
Suppress a finding: when cost lives in an integration that bypasses PBE.
Disable the detector: only when cost-priced products aren&apos;t used. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
